<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Pingroom — Track a room, live, together</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link
        href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap"
        rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg: #0A0E1A;
            --bg-panel: #11162380;
            --bg-panel-solid: #111623;
            --grid-line: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.07);
            --border: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.14);
            --border-strong: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.28);
            --text-main: #EDF1F7;
            --text-muted: #8993A8;
            --text-faint: #5C6577;
            --accent: #35D695;
            --accent-dim: rgba(53, 214, 149, 0.14);
            --accent-line: rgba(53, 214, 149, 0.35);
            --live: #F5B84C;
            --radius-sm: 8px;
            --radius-md: 14px;
            --radius-lg: 22px;
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        html {
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            background: var(--bg);
            color: var(--text-main);
            min-height: 100vh;
            line-height: 1.5;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        }

        /* ---------- ambient grid backdrop ---------- */
        .grid-backdrop {
            position: fixed;
            inset: 0;
            z-index: 0;
            pointer-events: none;
            background-image:
                linear-gradient(var(--grid-line) 1px, transparent 1px),
                linear-gradient(90deg, var(--grid-line) 1px, transparent 1px);
            background-size: 56px 56px;
            -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 60% at 50% 0%, black 10%, transparent 78%);
            mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 60% at 50% 0%, black 10%, transparent 78%);
        }

        .glow {
            position: fixed;
            z-index: 0;
            width: 640px;
            height: 640px;
            top: -220px;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(53, 214, 149, 0.12) 0%, transparent 70%);
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        a {
            color: inherit;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .mono {
            font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
        }

        .wrap {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            max-width: 1180px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 24px;
        }

        /* ---------- nav ---------- */
        .navbar {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 26px 0;
            gap: 16px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .logo {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            letter-spacing: -0.01em;
        }

        .logo-mark {
            width: 26px;
            height: 26px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            background: var(--accent-dim);
            border: 1px solid var(--accent-line);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .logo-mark span {
            width: 6px;
            height: 6px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: var(--accent);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px var(--accent-dim);
        }

        .nav-right {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 18px;
        }

        .live-pill {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            padding: 7px 14px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            background: var(--bg-panel);
            backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
            font-size: 0.78rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        .live-dot {
            width: 7px;
            height: 7px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: var(--live);
            position: relative;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .live-dot::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            inset: -4px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: var(--live);
            opacity: 0.5;
            animation: ping-soft 2.2s ease-out infinite;
        }

        .btn-nav {
            padding: 9px 18px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: var(--accent);
            color: #06170F;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            white-space: nowrap;
            transition: transform .25s ease, box-shadow .25s ease;
        }

        .btn-nav:hover {
            transform: translateY(-1px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 20px -6px rgba(53, 214, 149, 0.55);
        }

        /* ---------- hero ---------- */
        .hero {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 0.95fr;
            gap: 48px;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 56px 0 80px;
        }

        .eyebrow {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            font-size: 0.78rem;
            color: var(--accent);
            background: var(--accent-dim);
            border: 1px solid var(--accent-line);
            padding: 7px 13px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            margin-bottom: 22px;
            letter-spacing: 0.02em;
        }

        h1 {
            font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
            font-size: clamp(2.3rem, 4.6vw, 3.6rem);
            font-weight: 700;
            line-height: 1.08;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        h1 em {
            font-style: normal;
            color: var(--accent);
            position: relative;
        }

        p.subtitle {
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            max-width: 480px;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
            line-height: 1.65;
        }

        .cta-row {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 18px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            margin-bottom: 38px;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 15px 26px;
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            border-radius: 12px;
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: transform .25s ease, box-shadow .25s ease, background .25s ease;
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background: var(--accent);
            color: #06170F;
            box-shadow: 0 14px 30px -10px rgba(53, 214, 149, 0.55);
        }

        .btn-primary:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 18px 36px -8px rgba(53, 214, 149, 0.65);
        }

        .btn-icon {
            margin-left: 9px;
            transition: transform .25s ease;
        }

        .btn-primary:hover .btn-icon {
            transform: translateX(4px);
        }

        .btn-ghost {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 0.92rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            padding: 15px 4px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
            transition: color .2s ease, border-color .2s ease;
        }

        .btn-ghost:hover {
            color: var(--text-main);
            border-color: var(--border-strong);
        }

        .stat-strip {
            display: flex;
            gap: 28px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            padding-top: 26px;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
        }

        .stat {
            min-width: 110px;
        }

        .stat-num {
            font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            color: var(--text-main);
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .stat-label {
            font-size: 0.76rem;
            color: var(--text-faint);
            margin-top: 2px;
        }

        /* ---------- radar signature visual ---------- */
        .radar-wrap {
            position: relative;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 420px;
            aspect-ratio: 1;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .radar-panel {
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, #0D1220 0%, #090C15 70%);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .radar-ring {
            position: absolute;
            border: 1px solid var(--grid-line);
            border-radius: 50%;
            top: 50%;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
        }

        .r1 {
            width: 78%;
            height: 78%;
        }

        .r2 {
            width: 54%;
            height: 54%;
        }

        .r3 {
            width: 30%;
            height: 30%;
        }

        .radar-cross {
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
        }

        .radar-cross::before,
        .radar-cross::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            background: var(--grid-line);
        }

        .radar-cross::before {
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            top: 50%;
            height: 1px;
        }

        .radar-cross::after {
            top: 0;
            bottom: 0;
            left: 50%;
            width: 1px;
        }

        .radar-sweep {
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: conic-gradient(from 0deg, rgba(53, 214, 149, 0.32), transparent 26%);
            animation: sweep 4.5s linear infinite;
        }

        .radar-center {
            position: absolute;
            top: 50%;
            left: 50%;
            width: 8px;
            height: 8px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: var(--accent);
            transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 5px var(--accent-dim);
        }

        .radar-dot {
            position: absolute;
            width: 9px;
            height: 9px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: var(--live);
            transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
        }

        .radar-dot::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            inset: -3px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: var(--live);
            opacity: 0.55;
            animation: ping-soft 2.6s ease-out infinite;
        }

        .radar-tag {
            position: absolute;
            font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
            font-size: 0.66rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            background: #0B0F19;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            padding: 3px 7px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            white-space: nowrap;
            transform: translate(-50%, -140%);
        }

        .dot-a {
            top: 30%;
            left: 64%;
        }

        .dot-b {
            top: 66%;
            left: 38%;
            animation-delay: .8s;
        }

        .dot-c {
            top: 44%;
            left: 78%;
            animation-delay: 1.6s;
        }

        @keyframes sweep {
            to {
                transform: rotate(360deg);
            }
        }

        @keyframes ping-soft {
            0% {
                transform: scale(0.7);
                opacity: 0.7;
            }

            75% {
                opacity: 0;
            }

            100% {
                transform: scale(2.6);
                opacity: 0;
            }
        }

        /* ---------- how it works ---------- */
        .section {
            padding: 70px 0;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .section-head {
            max-width: 560px;
            margin-bottom: 44px;
        }

        .section-eyebrow {
            font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            color: var(--accent);
            letter-spacing: 0.08em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .section-title {
            font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
            font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.1rem);
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: -0.01em;
        }

        .steps {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .step-card {
            background: var(--bg-panel);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
            padding: 28px 24px;
            backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
            position: relative;
            transition: border-color .25s ease, transform .25s ease;
        }

        .step-card:hover {
            border-color: var(--border-strong);
            transform: translateY(-3px);
        }

        .step-num {
            font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
            font-size: 0.78rem;
            color: var(--accent);
            background: var(--accent-dim);
            border: 1px solid var(--accent-line);
            width: 30px;
            height: 30px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
        }

        .step-title {
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .step-desc {
            font-size: 0.92rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .step-connector {
            display: none;
        }

        /* ---------- why cards ---------- */
        .why-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .why-card {
            padding: 26px 22px;
            border-radius: var(--radius-md);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.015), transparent);
        }

        .why-icon {
            width: 38px;
            height: 38px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            background: var(--bg-panel-solid);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            color: var(--accent);
        }

        .why-title {
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
            font-size: 1rem;
        }

        .why-desc {
            font-size: 0.88rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* ---------- footer ---------- */
        footer {
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
            padding: 32px 0 40px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .footer-inner {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 16px;
        }

        .footer-tagline {
            font-size: 0.82rem;
            color: var(--text-faint);
        }

        .footer-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 22px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        .footer-links a:hover {
            color: var(--text-main);
        }

        /* ---------- responsive ---------- */
        @media (max-width: 960px) {
            .hero {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                text-align: center;
                padding-top: 36px;
            }

            p.subtitle {
                margin-left: auto;
                margin-right: auto;
            }

            .cta-row {
                justify-content: center;
            }

            .stat-strip {
                justify-content: center;
            }

            .radar-wrap {
                margin-top: 8px;
            }

            .steps,
            .why-grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 640px) {
            .navbar {
                padding: 20px 0;
            }

            .live-pill span.mono {
                display: none;
            }

            .hero {
                padding: 28px 0 56px;
                gap: 36px;
            }

            .radar-wrap {
                max-width: 300px;
            }

            .btn,
            .btn-primary {
                width: 100%;
            }

            .cta-row {
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: stretch;
            }

            .btn-ghost {
                justify-content: center;
            }

            .stat-strip {
                gap: 22px;
            }

            .steps,
            .why-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .section {
                padding: 50px 0;
            }

            .footer-inner {
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: flex-start;
            }
        }

        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {

            .radar-sweep,
            .live-dot::after,
            .radar-dot::after {
                animation: none;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <div class="grid-backdrop"></div>
    <div class="glow"></div>

    <div class="wrap">
        <nav class="navbar">
            <div class="logo">
                <span class="logo-mark"><span></span></span>
                Pingroom
            </div>
            <div class="nav-right">
                <div class="live-pill">
                    <span class="live-dot"></span>
                    <span class="mono">User rooms live now</span>
                </div>
                <a href="/app" class="btn-nav">Open app</a>
            </div>
        </nav>

        <section class="hero">
            <div>
                <div class="eyebrow mono">● v6.0 — no account, no download</div>
                <h1>Watch a room <em>move</em>,<br>together, in real time.</h1>
                <p class="subtitle">
                    Spin up a room, share one link, and see everyone's position update live on the map.
                    Nothing is saved — when the room closes, the trail is gone with it.
                </p>
                <div class="cta-row">
                    <a href="/app" class="btn btn-primary">
                        Create a room
                        <svg class="btn-icon" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"
                            stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                            <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line>
                            <polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline>
                        </svg>
                    </a>
                    <a href="#how" class="btn-ghost">See how it works ↓</a>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-strip">
                    <div class="stat">
                        <div class="stat-num mono">&lt;4s</div>
                        <div class="stat-label">to join a room</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat">
                        <div class="stat-num mono">0</div>
                        <div class="stat-label">accounts required</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat">
                        <div class="stat-num mono">0kb</div>
                        <div class="stat-label">stored after close</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="radar-wrap">
                <div class="radar-panel">
                    <div class="radar-ring r1"></div>
                    <div class="radar-ring r2"></div>
                    <div class="radar-ring r3"></div>
                    <div class="radar-cross"></div>
                    <div class="radar-sweep"></div>
                    <div class="radar-center"></div>

                    <div class="radar-dot dot-a"></div>
                    <div class="radar-tag" style="top:30%; left:64%;">40.71°N</div>

                    <div class="radar-dot dot-b"></div>
                    <div class="radar-tag" style="top:66%; left:38%;">37.77°N</div>

                    <div class="radar-dot dot-c"></div>
                    <div class="radar-tag" style="top:44%; left:78%;">51.50°N</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="section" id="how">
            <div class="section-head">
                <div class="section-eyebrow">How it works</div>
                <div class="section-title">Three steps, no setup screen.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="steps">
                <div class="step-card">
                    <div class="step-num mono">01</div>
                    <div class="step-title">Create a room</div>
                    <div class="step-desc">Pick a name and, if you want, a PIN. You get a link instantly — no forms, no
                        sign-up.</div>
                </div>
                <div class="step-card">
                    <div class="step-num mono">02</div>
                    <div class="step-title">Share the link</div>
                    <div class="step-desc">Send it to anyone. It opens straight in their browser — nothing to install.
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="step-card">
                    <div class="step-num mono">03</div>
                    <div class="step-title">Watch it live</div>
                    <div class="step-desc">Everyone's position updates on the map as it happens, then disappears when
                        the room closes.</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="section">
            <div class="section-head">
                <div class="section-eyebrow">Built this way on purpose</div>
                <div class="section-title">Made for the moment, not the archive.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="why-grid">
                <div class="why-card">
                    <div class="why-icon">
                        <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                            stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                            <path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path>
                            <circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle>
                            <line x1="23" y1="11" x2="17" y2="11"></line>
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <div class="why-title">No accounts</div>
                    <div class="why-desc">A room is identified by its link, not a login. Anyone with it can join, no
                        signup wall.</div>
                </div>
                <div class="why-card">
                    <div class="why-icon">
                        <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                            stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
                            <polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"></polyline>
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <div class="why-title">Nothing kept</div>
                    <div class="why-desc">Positions live in memory for the length of the session. Close the room and the
                        trail is gone.</div>
                </div>
                <div class="why-card">
                    <div class="why-icon">
                        <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                            stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                            <polygon points="1 6 1 22 8 18 16 22 23 18 23 2 16 6 8 2 1 6"></polygon>
                            <line x1="8" y1="2" x2="8" y2="18"></line>
                            <line x1="16" y1="6" x2="16" y2="22"></line>
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <div class="why-title">Real maps</div>
                    <div class="why-desc">Built on Leaflet, with clustering for busy rooms and routing when you need
                        directions, not just dots.</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </div>

    <footer>
        <div class="wrap footer-inner">
            <div class="footer-tagline">Pingroom — ephemeral by design.</div>
            <div class="footer-links">
                <a href="/app">Open app</a>
                <a href="#how">How it works</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </footer>

</body>

</html>